{"ts": "2026-08-17T10:53:45Z", "agent": "claude", "seq": 24, "kind": "tool_result", "text": "1\t\"\"\"In-memory task store.\n2\t\n3\tDeliberately not a database: this project exists to exercise a development\n4\tpipeline, and a real datastore would add setup cost to every cycle without\n5\tadding anything to test. Adding one is a decision, not an implementation\n6\tdetail.\n7\t\"\"\"\n8\tfrom typing import Optional\n9\t\n10\tfrom .models import Task\n11\t\n12\t\n13\tclass TaskStore:\n14\t    def __init__(self):\n15\t        self._tasks: dict[int, Task] = {}\n16\t        self._next_id = 1\n17\t\n18\t    def list(self) -> list[Task]:\n19\t        return [self._tasks[k] for k in sorted(self._tasks)]\n20\t\n21\t    def add(self, title: str) -> Task:\n22\t        task = Task(id=self._next_id, title=title)\n23\t        self._tasks[task.id] = task\n24\t        self._next_id += 1\n25\t        return task\n26\t\n27\t    def get(self, task_id: int) -> Optional[Task]:\n28\t        return self._tasks.get(task_id)\n29\t\n30\t    def set_done(self, task_id: int, done: bool) -> Optional[Task]:\n31\t        task = self._tasks.get(task_id)\n32\t        if task is None:\n33\t            return None\n34\t        task.done = done\n35\t        return task\n36\t\n37\t    def update_title(self, task_id: int, title: str) -> Optional[Task]:\n38\t        task = self._tasks.get(task_id)\n39\t        if task is None:\n40\t            return None\n41\t        task.title = title\n42\t        return task\n43\t\n44\t    def delete(self, task_id: int) -> bool:\n45\t        return self._tasks.pop(task_id, None) is not None\n46\t\n47\t    def reset(self) -> None:\n48\t        self._tasks.clear()\n49\t        self._next_id = 1\n50\t\n51\t\n52\tstore = TaskStore()\n53\t", "meta": {"native_type": "user", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01ESFnbNxJKHGqq56yxnJEcZ", "session_id": "5050ad49-a79b-4044-8c08-7ab6658e49c6"}}
